\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Phase diagrams for MC guidance across coupling strength (columns, from the independent coupling to exact OT) and the width $\sigma $ of the energy function (rows, from sharp at the top to broad at the bottom). Stronger coupling consistently increases the energy distance and the off-manifold rate, while the diversity trace ratio stays close to one throughout, showing that the independence assumption behind MC guidance degrades gradually rather than suddenly as the training coupling tightens.}}{10}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:phase_diagrams}{{5}{10}{Phase diagrams for MC guidance across coupling strength (columns, from the independent coupling to exact OT) and the width $\sigma $ of the energy function (rows, from sharp at the top to broad at the bottom). Stronger coupling consistently increases the energy distance and the off-manifold rate, while the diversity trace ratio stays close to one throughout, showing that the independence assumption behind MC guidance degrades gradually rather than suddenly as the training coupling tightens}{figure.caption.6}{}}
